    "name": "Ecommerce Verina API",
    "description": "Ecommerce Verina API (Express + MongoDB + Cloudinary).\n\nVariables: baseUrl (http://localhost:5000/api), token (set by Login/Register tests), categoryId, productId, orderId.\n\nFlow: Register (admin) → Create category → optional Upload requests or multipart create → Register/Login as seller → Create product (needs categoryId) → Cart → Orders.\n\nCloudinary: set CLOUDINARY_* and UPLOADS_FOLDER in server .env. Upload field names: category image = image, product files = images.",
